EVALUATION.md §5, IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN §7.6, DECISIONS 446: an entry holding a record literal its root's walk never reaches (ws.one's v fits no branch of P(a)): the literal is judged once, and a replay of the entry gives what a cold evaluation gives.
